    {
        "name": "tv_settings",
        "description": "Open a Fire TV settings page on the TV: network (Wi-Fi), device (About, Developer options, "
                       "restart), apps, controllers (remotes and Bluetooth), display (picture and sound), preferences, "
                       "accessibility, equipment (soundbar, CEC), livetv, notifications, alexa, sleeptimer, help. "
                       "Leave page out for Amazon's settings grid, which the remote can't move around in on this "
                       "TV, so prefer a page.",
        "inputSchema": {
            "type": "object",
